{"_path":"/articles/windowslinux","_dir":"articles","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"如何将Windows电脑改为Linux服务器？","description":"本地办公电脑闲置，可以改造成Linux服务器用于本地开发备份数据，是再好不过了。","date":"2026-08-01","tags":["Linux","服务器","运维","Nginx","Docker","Shell"],"body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"如何将windows电脑改为linux服务器"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如何将Windows电脑改为Linux服务器？"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"div","props":{"id":"cnblogs_post_body","className":["blogpost-body","blogpost-body-html"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本地办公电脑闲置，可以改造成Linux服务器用于本地开发备份数据，是再好不过了。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"准备如下："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.一个办公电脑，假设为A，内存不低于8g，硬盘不小于100g，网络网段都在192.168.1.*（用作即将改造为Linux服务器）；"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.一个U盘，假设为B，不小于8g，（用于制作启动盘）"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.一个正常使用的电脑，假设为C，能联网打开等（用于本地操作制作启动盘，及开发、连接本地服务器）"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"步骤如下："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.使用设备C，格式化U盘，并下载Rufus 启动盘制作工具,该工具下载后，开箱即用，不必安装，所以必须将此工具置于C设备中（桌面即可），"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624120808194-714321525.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.打开Rufus工具，设备栏会自动识别U盘设备，引导类型选择，在后方的选择按钮点击后，选择下载的镜像即可。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下载镜像地址： Rockylinux:https://rockylinux.org/zh-CN/download"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624113611639-1950242643.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.点击开始后，弹出提示框，选择默认项——以ISO镜像 模式写入（推荐），即可"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624121000980-930338554.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 4.继续弹出弹窗，提示会删除U盘设备的所有数据，点击是，继续执行即可"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624121259748-1471777684.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 5.如下，镜像复制成功后，即代表U盘启动盘做好了。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624122617569-1495806379.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 二，改造工作电脑为本地Linux服务器步骤："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.将启动U盘插到主机后方的蓝色USB接口（3.0，读取较容易）"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.开机A电脑，按F2或F12或F8，不同主板，BIOS的键不一样，打开BIOS选项，选择U盘名称，如Kingston ***，即表示即将进读取磁盘内容"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.进入后选择第三个：*Install Rocky Linux Minimal 9.8 in FIPS mode"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624133854132-631355725.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 4.回车后，立即进行安装流程："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624134240008-2028020073.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 5.完成安装后，进入语言选项配置：选择中文，简体中文即可"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624134318352-1181883597.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.选择语言后，弹出设置面板，按图设置好。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624140542666-1074187330.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 7.其中第三项，安装目标位置，可按以下设置，默认自动即可："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624140742956-1379778229.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 8.如果所选区域，选定后提示：磁盘空间不足，且弹出以下弹窗，点击回收空间即可："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141007357-424204497.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 9.回收空间的意思，表示从安装的设备磁盘中，找出可用空间，但因为不在乎之前的办公Windows系统，直接全选磁盘即可，再点击全部删除，即可回收空间："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141133279-1548853187.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 10.又会回到设置界面，点击用户设置下，设置root密码，另外可以设置一个用户（除root外的另外用户），"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141359589-1329239252.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"11.点击开始安装，等待安装完成，提示如图，即表示安装成功。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141459916-990389528.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 12.回车后，自动进入提示登录Linux命令界面，输入root及密码，即可进入系统，再次输入 ip addr,获取当前的服务器IP，"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141837916-1012287885.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 13.输入nmtui,打开图形化设置SSH配置项，如图，IPv4 CONFIGURATION，设置Automatic为Manual，填入IP，网关，DNS等参数，按键到OK，即可。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624141929661-1395836979.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 14.选择Back，回到主设置界面，"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624142345326-627353097.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 15.选择Activate a connection，以激活配置。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624142416953-682216143.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 16.先暂停激活，再通过按键，选择Activate激活。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624142600561-1799060899.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 17.选择back后，回到主界面，再选择quit，推出此配置："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624142655669-876414118.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 18.输入 ip a show enp1s0，检查配置："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624142954717-167699102.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 19.输入vi /etc/ssh/sshd_config，配置SSHD配置文件，开启root登录方式，即修改#PermitRootLogin prohibit-password 为 "},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"style":"font-style: italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"PermitRootLogin yes"}]},{"type":"text","value":"："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624143203822-1275647838.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 20.输入：wq，保存修改后，再输入 "},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":["hljs","language-bash"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"systemctl restart sshd ，重启状态（没有提示，即表示OK）；"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"三：配置防火墙允许SSH，Rocky 9默认使用"},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"firewalld"}]},{"type":"text","value":"防火墙，默认不会开放SSH，需要手动放行："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.输入命令：firewall-cmd --permanent --add-service=ssh，提示success，即成功。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624143747090-485452132.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" 2."},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-comment"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"重载防火墙使规则生效 firewall-cmd --reload，，如上图，"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-comment"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3."}]},{"type":"text","value":"确认网卡和网络配置，"},{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"className":["hljs","language-bash"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ip a show enp1s0，，如上图，"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4.使用终端工具，如xShell，或者FinalShell，登录测试即可："}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"img","props":{"src":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/962554/202606/962554-20260624144622335-1641319678.png","alt":"image","loading":"lazy"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"四，可选，加速SSH连接"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"sed -i "},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\"s/GSSAPIAuthentication yes/GSSAPIAuthentication no/g\" /etc/ssh/sshd_config "}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"sed -i "},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\"s/#UseDNS yes/UseDNS no/g\" /etc/ssh/sshd_config "}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"systemctl restart sshd"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"五：参考："}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{"id":"articleContentId","className":["title-article"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rocky Linux 安装保姆级教程："},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://blog.csdn.net/y12345678dd/article/details/154943276"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{"id":"articleContentId","className":["title-article"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rocky Linux 10 静态 IP 配置："},{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"span","props":{"className":["hljs-string"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_58159763/article/details/159798933"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"二级标题"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"二级标题"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"列表项"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"列表项"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-javascript shiki shik